@startuml states
' SplitSmart - Expense lifecycle (reconciled candidate)
' Sources: data-model.md section 6.1; design.md sections 5.1-5.2, 8.2. Invitation: states-invitation.puml. Payment: states-payment.puml.
title SplitSmart - Expense State Machine (invalid transitions explicit)

hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> PENDING : submit\n[active member; all validation passes]\n/ store shares; notify other active members; audit

PENDING --> PENDING : edit\n[actor = submitter; version matches; valid]\n/ recompute shares; version+1; audit before/after
PENDING --> APPROVED : approve\n[ReviewPolicy allows; version matches]\n/ ReviewDecision(level 1); notify parties; audit
PENDING --> REJECTED : reject\n[ReviewPolicy allows; version matches]\n/ ReviewDecision + reason; notify parties; audit

state PENDING : visible as "Pending review"
state PENDING : excluded from balances (FR-006, AC-010)
state APPROVED : included in balances (AC-011)
state APPROVED : immutable
state REJECTED : never in balances (AC-012)
state REJECTED : immutable; reason visible

state "Rejected requests (no state change)" as Invalid #EEEEEE
Invalid : APPROVED/REJECTED -> any transition => EXPENSE_NOT_PENDING (409)
Invalid : stale version => CONCURRENT_MODIFICATION (409)
Invalid : edit by non-submitter => FORBIDDEN_ROLE (403)
Invalid : decide own expense w/o self-approval => SELF_APPROVAL_NOT_ALLOWED (403)
Invalid : no DRAFT state; no DELETED state (OQ-6)

APPROVED --> [*]
REJECTED --> [*]
@enduml
